    "home.h2.a-revolution-in-how-we-understand": "Inguquko yokuthi Sibuqonda Kanjani Ubudlelwano Bethu nabanye kanye Nezingxenye Zethu Ezihlukene Ezingqubuzanayo",
    "home.p.untangle-the-complexities-of-life-in": "Hlubula ubunkimbinkimbi bempilo kulo mhlaba wesimanje, wedijithali ngokuxhuma kabusha nobuhlakani bakudala bezilwane ezine eziyingqayizivele totems owazalwa nazo.",
