    "home.p.find-the-people-and-opportunities-that": "Thola abantu namathuba afana nabaqondisi bakho - ubungane, umphakathi, neziqalo ezintsha.",
    "home.h3.totem-connections-directory": "Totem Connections Directory",
    "home.p.opt-in-with-your-four-totem": "Ngena nezilwane zakho ezine ze-totem bese uphequlula ezinye kusizindalwazi somphakathi - umataniswa noThingo, Ithunzi, i-Trine, noma i-Mirror uxhumano.",
    "home.h3.totem-animals-calculator": "Totem Animals Calculator",
    "home.p.discover-your-four-totem-animal-guides": "Zitholele imihlahlandlela yakho yezilwane ezine ze-totem mahhala - Ezokomoya, Ezengqondo, Ezomzwelo, Nezomzimba - kusukela ngosuku lwakho lokuzalwa, isikhathi, nedolobha.",
    "home.section-label.book-a-session": "Bhukha Iseshini",
