    "page.terms.trademark.p.totem-astrology-is-a-distinct-interpreti": "Totem Astrology uhlelo lokuhumusha oluhlukile — lugqugquzelwe yendabuko yaseChina yokuhlolwa kweFour Pillars kodwa lwakhiwe, lwahlelwa, futhi lwabizwa ngokuzimele iminyaka eminingi. Aluhlangene nezinsizakalo zokubikezela ikusasa ezivamile ze-BaZi, izikhungo zamasiko, noma olunye uphawu lwezinkanyezi.",
    "page.terms.trademark.p.you-may-not-use-the-totem": "Awukwazi ukusebenzisa igama Totem Astrology, uphawu lomkhiqizo wesizinda, noma izimpawu ezifanayo ngokudidanisa ukuze ubonise ukusekelwa, ubambiswano, noma ubunikazi balolu hlelo ngaphandle kwemvume ebhaliwe.",
