    "page.conn.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to": "Inani elabelwe wonke umuntu — zombili izilwane zingezakwa-Values Triangle efanayo, ngakho ngokuvamile nikhuluma ulimi olufanayo uma kuziwa ezikhaleni zokuphila ezibalulekile.",
    "page.conn.h3.same-as-me": "Okufana nami",
    "page.conn.p.the-same-totem-animal-at-the": "Isilwane esifanayo setotem embizeni efanayo — noma isilwane esifanayo ku-‘ring’ ehlukile esizalwa eminyakeni engu-12, 24, noma 36 ehlukene. Abaqondisi abafanayo; abantu abahlukahlukene ngokumangalisayo.",
    "page.conn.connections-join-form.label.i-agree-to-list-my-display": "Ngiyavuma ukufaka igama lami lokubonisa, izilwane zami ezine zophawu lwesiko, indawo engakhethwa, isingeniso, kanye ne-imeyili engakhethwa kuleli thala lomphakathi ngemva kokubuyekezwa.",
    "page.conn.connections-join-form.p.page-build-20260883": "Ikhasi lokwakha 20260883",
    "page.conn.section-label.five-connection-modes.2": "Izindlela Ezinhlanu Zokuxhumana",
    "page.conn.h2.how-matching-works.2": "Indlela Ukuhambelana Okusebenza ngayo",
    "page.conn.p.each-person-has-four-totem-animals.2": "Umuntu ngamunye unezilwane ezine zokholo — Umoya, Ingqondo, Inhliziyo, Nomzimba. Siqhathanisa ikholomu efanayo phakathi kwabantu ababili bese sinika amamaki ezindlela ezihlanu zokuxhumana.",
    "page.conn.connections-join-form.label.i-agree-to-list-my-display.2": "Ngiyavuma ukufaka igama lami lokubonisa, izilwane zami ezine zophawu lwesiko, indawo engakhethwa, isingeniso, kanye ne-imeyili engakhethwa kule ncwadi yomphakathi ngemva kokubukeza.",
    "page.conn.connections-join-form.p.page-build-20260883.2": "Ikhasi lokwakha 20260883",
    "page.connType.rainbow.section-label.connection-type": "Uhlobo Lokuxhumana",
    "page.connType.rainbow.h1.rainbow": "Iribhoni",
    "page.connType.rainbow.p.yin-and-yang-companions-each-one": "Abezihlobo bakaYin noYang — ngamunye ukhombisa imibala yangempela yesinye isilwane njengomkhanyiseli wemicibisholo, yingakho kuthiwa \"Umbala Wamagiya.\" Ukubambisana okungajwayelekile okufanele kugcinwe lapho ukuhlasela kukhona.",
    "page.connType.rainbow.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.rainbow.p.yin-and-yang-companions-each-one.2": "Abangani be-Yin no-Yang — Ngamunye uveza imibala yangempela yesinye isilwane njengophiko lwemibala, yingakho kuthiwa “I-Rainbow” — ngalo hlobo lokuxhumana, awuqondi nje ukuthi nibonakala kanjani niyakhanya! Kuyinhlanganisela engavamile, futhi kufanele uyigcine lapho uyithola! Kudinga umsebenzi omningi ngawe uqobo ngaphambi kokuba abantu abaningi bakulungele lolu hlobo lokuxhumana — ekugcineni, yonke imibala yangempela yakho izobonakala ngaso sonke isikhathi, ngakho kungcono uqinisekise ukuthi zonke izinhlangothi zakho zikhazimulile futhi zicwebezelayo!",
    "page.connType.rainbow.h3.other-connection-types": "Ezinye izinhlobo zokuxhumana",
    "page.connType.rainbow.li.shadow": "<a href=\"connection-shadow.html?v=20260807\">Umthunzi</a>",
    "page.connType.rainbow.li.mirror-opposite": "<a href=\"connection-mirror-opposite.html?v=20260807\">Isibuko Esiphambene</a>",
    "page.connType.rainbow.li.values-trine": "<a href=\"connection-values-trine.html?v=20260807\">Amagugu Trine</a>",
    "page.connType.rainbow.li.same-as-me": "<a href=\"connection-same-as-me.html?v=20260807\">Ufana-Nami</a>",
    "page.connType.rainbow.h2.find-rainbow-matches": "Thola Imidlalo Yezinhlamvu Zemibala",
    "page.connType.rainbow.p.calculate-your-four-totem-animals-then": "Bala izilwane zakho ezine zama-totem, bese ubheka kumbhalo wokubhalisa okuzithandela wabantu ababelana ngalolu hlobo lokuxhumana nawe.",
    "page.connType.rainbow.btn.totem-connections-directory": "Totem Connections Directory",
    "page.connType.rainbow.btn.totem-animals-calculator": "Totem Animals Calculator",
    "page.connType.shadow.section-label.connection-type": "Uhlobo Lokuxhumana",
    "page.connType.shadow.h1.shadow": "Umthunzi",
    "page.connType.shadow.p.a-darkly-magnetic-yin-yang-pairing": "Ukubambana kwe-Yin-Yang okumnyama okuheha kakhulu okukhombisa okungaphansi okwafihlekile komunye nomunye — kukhombisa lokho okungenzeka ukuthi kungahlali kufihlakele, noma ungakuthandi noma cha.",
    "page.connType.shadow.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.shadow.p.this-darkly-magnetic-yin-yang-animal": "Lolu hlangothi lwesilwane esinomlingo omnyama we-Yin-Yang lukhombisa izimfihlo zomunye nomunye — lukhombisa lokho okungase kungabonakali, noma ungakuthandi noma cha! Kuyisimo esihle sokusebenza ngekharma, kukusiza nonke ukuthi nikhule ngokuhlala nizibophezele ebuhlotsheni futhi nithole lezo zinto okufanele nizisebenzise ndawonye. Ngikubonile kubantu abanothando abaningi, ngisho noshade nabashadikazi ababejabulile iminyaka, kodwa futhi ngikubonile kalula kakhulu kubafundi-nothando lwezikole noma kwabazali-nezingane, lapho umqondo wokulungisa amaphutha akho nokuzithuthukisa usuvele usungene kulolo hlobo lobudlelwano.",
    "page.connType.shadow.h3.other-connection-types": "Ezinye izinhlobo zokuxhumana",
    "page.connType.shadow.li.rainbow": "<a href=\"connection-rainbow.html?v=20260807\">Umsindo wombala</a>",
