    "page.connType.values-trine.p.calculate-your-four-totem-animals-then": "Bala izilwane zakho ezine zama-totem, bese ubheka kusethi yabantu abafisa ukuhlanganyela lolu hlobo lokuxhumana nawe.",
    "page.connType.values-trine.btn.totem-connections-directory": "Totem Connections Directory",
    "page.connType.values-trine.btn.totem-animals-calculator": "Totem Animals Calculator",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.section-label.connection-type": "Uhlobo Lokuxhumana",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.h1.same-as-me": "Okufana nami",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.p.the-same-totem-animal-at-the": "Isilwane esifanayo setotem embizeni efanayo — noma isilwane esifanayo ku-‘ring’ ehlukile esizalwa eminyakeni engu-12, 24, noma 36 ehlukene. Abaqondisi abafanayo; abantu abahlukahlukene ngokumangalisayo.",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.p.the-same-totem-animal-at-the.2": "Isilwane esifanayo sothembele ezingeni elifanayo — umuntu ohlanganyela umoya wakho, ingqondo, inhliziyo, noma umzimba ngendlela efanayo. Kungaba futhi abantu abavela ku-'rings' ezehlukene ngokusho kokukhuluma — ngenye indlela, abantu abazalwe iminyaka engu-12, 24, 36, noma enye inani elihlanganayo le-12 evela kuwe. Ngokwesibonelo, mina ngiyiNgonyama yomlilo ezalwe ngo-1986, kodwa nginabo abangani nomndeni wami abakhulu beNgonyama abavela kuma-ring ahlukene eNgonyama — omunye wamalungu omndeni wami u-uncle unguyiNgonyama Yamanzi ezalwe ngo-1962, indodana yami inguNgonyama Yensimbi ezalwa ngo-2010, futhi abangani abaningi abathandekayo, abafundi, kanye nabalingani bangamaNgonyama Amoshozalayo abazakhele umhlaba ezalwa ngo-1998. Ngibe nabalingani abasebenza nabo abazalwe ngonyaka weNgonyama Wensimu yobuhlanga, ngo-1974. Kungaba kujabulisa ukubona ukuthi izilwane zakho zithini lapho zinamandla ahlukene okuphakelwa kwabanye abantu. Kungaba kuhle futhi ukuthola abantu abazalwe ngosuku olufanayo nawe, ukuze babe nazo zonke izilwane eziyiziqondiso ezifanayo, noma okungenani ezintathu kwezine uma isilwane sesikhathi sihlukile, futhi ukubona ukuthi bakhethe kanjani ukuhlela izandla zabo ngendlela ehlukile kunaleyo oseyikhethile — okufana nendlela amawele 'afanayo' ahlukile ngayo ngezindlela eziningi, kodwa ehlanganyela izinto eziningi kwezinye izindawo. Inhloso yakho yokuzikhethela iyinto enamandla, futhi lokhu kuxhumana kukhombisa lokho ngokucacile kakhulu. Izilwane zokuzalwa eziqondisayo zifanayo, kodwa abantu abaqondiswa yizo basaphuma behlukile ngokuphelele futhi kahle kakhulu :)",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.h3.other-connection-types": "Ezinye izinhlobo zokuxhumana",
