    "page.about.h3.hour-body": "Uair · Corp",
    "page.about.p.this-animal-speaks-to-us-through": "Labhraíonn an t-ainmhí seo linn trí theanga an instinct.",
    "page.about.btn.reveal-your-four-guides": "Nocht do cheithre threoir",
